#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_lockin_detection.ipynb:10002
#: cd4e39e98ef44f90bd455081648f7f3d
msgid "Lock-in Detection: Recovering Weak AM/FM Structure"
msgstr "ロックイン検出: 弱い AM/FM 構造の復元"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_lockin_detection.ipynb:20002
#: 4a61440f70e845feb888074f3ef444e8
msgid ""
"Lock-in detection is the right tool when the physically interesting "
"information lives as a **slow modulation** on a much faster carrier. The "
"goal is not to measure the carrier itself, but to move the modulation into "
"baseband where low-frequency trend tools can recover it."
msgstr ""
"ロックイン検出は、**速い搬送波の上に乗ったゆっくりした変調** を取り出したいときに使います。見たいのはキャリアそのものではなく、baseband "
"へ落とした後に残る振幅・位相のトレンドです。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_lockin_detection.ipynb:20004
#: 849d56fdd497431fbeb5327fffc80d52
msgid ""
"This public version is distilled from the legacy heterodyne notebook and "
"focuses on the essential AM/FM recovery workflow."
msgstr "この公開版 notebook は legacy のヘテロダイン例を整理し、AM/FM 復元の本質に絞っています。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_lockin_detection.ipynb:40002
#: a66d5f7da2274f2093ec29ccff60b73c
msgid "1. Recover amplitude and phase with `lock_in`"
msgstr "1. `lock_in` で振幅と位相を取り出す"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_lockin_detection.ipynb:40004
#: 9d1918256b7248a9981c6fb3781cabc0
msgid ""
"The reference frequency tells the algorithm which coherent part of the "
"waveform to keep. Broadband noise averages away, while the slow AM/FM "
"structure survives."
msgstr "参照周波数を与えることで、キャリアと同相な成分だけを残し、広帯域雑音を平均で落とします。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_lockin_detection.ipynb:60002
#: aae30bfa4cbc4324a530a7293a30abc7
msgid "2. Manual demodulation shows the same physics"
msgstr "2. 手動復調でも同じ物理が見える"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_lockin_detection.ipynb:60004
#: b346cfb1c8184828b1274d5143bab291
msgid ""
"Mixing with cosine/sine creates a DC term plus an image at `2*f_c`. The low-"
"pass filter rejects that high-frequency image so only the slow envelope and "
"phase drift remain."
msgstr ""
"参照波との積を取ると DC 成分と `2*f_c` 成分ができます。低域フィルタは後者を落とし、ゆっくりした包絡と位相ドリフトだけを残します。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_lockin_detection.ipynb:80002
#: e2855396b4fc4b2581975af07258bcab
msgid "3. Demodulation moves the information into baseband"
msgstr "3. 復調すると情報は低周波へ移る"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_lockin_detection.ipynb:80004
#: 02fdaea90be4449aa32393bc38b0fdd5
msgid ""
"After demodulation, the interesting structure is centered near zero "
"frequency. That is why lock-in detection turns a high-frequency carrier "
"problem into a low-frequency trend-analysis problem."
msgstr "復調後のスペクトルは 0 Hz 近傍に集まるので、高周波キャリア問題が低周波トレンド解析の問題へ変わります。"
